{"src":"ko","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":176700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ko","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":10140.515138,"text":"만약 내셔널 트레저라는 영화를 봤다면 아마 독립선언서의 뒷면에 보물 지도가 쓰여졌다고 생각할지도 모른다."},{"kind":"text","t":10949.59321,"text":"If you’ve seen the movie National Treasure, you might think that a treasure map is written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":11048.76489,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11053.330371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":11058.862985,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":470,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11064.206373,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11069.444462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11074.691551,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":11076.011608,"samples":12192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":16647.891959,"text":"핫초콜릿은 벨기에 표준에 따릅니다. 과일저스는 비싸지만 아주 맛있습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":17152.414772000004,"text":"Hot chocolate follows Belgian standards. Fruit Jesus is expensive, but it’s extremely delicious."},{"kind":"audio","t":17245.759102999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17250.860545000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":17251.70033,"samples":11864,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":17333.436193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17338.209049999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17343.481999000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":17344.232486,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":26577.905967,"text":"하지만 그것은 사실이 아닙니다. 서류 뒷면에 뭔가 적힌 게 있더라도 이건 보물 지도가 아닙니다."},{"kind":"text","t":27327.843975000003,"text":"But that’s not true. Even if there’s something written on the back of the document, it’s not a treasure map."},{"kind":"audio","t":27415.841678999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27417.074376999997,"samples":16432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"audio","t":27495.113614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27500.600479,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27505.460444999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27510.788482000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":27511.111357,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":35322.122635,"text":"자신의 의견이 아닌 정부의 의견을 듣고 싶을 수도 있지만 각국 정부의 조언들은 자국민에 맞춰져 있다."},{"kind":"text","t":36210.596191000004,"text":"You might want to hear the government’s opinion rather than your own, but the advice from governments around the world is tailored to their own citizens."},{"kind":"audio","t":36318.137246,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36323.119649,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36328.182792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":840},{"kind":"audio","t":36333.568488000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36338.848627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36344.162325000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36348.256674000004,"samples":30192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":43766.166018,"text":"홍콩섬은 홍콩 영토에 홍콩이라는 이름을 부여한 곳이자 많은 관광객들이 주안점으로 여기는 곳이다."},{"kind":"text","t":44616.245429,"text":"Hong Kong Island is the place that gave the territory its name, Hong Kong, and it is also a key destination for many tourists."},{"kind":"audio","t":44726.252431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44731.168326,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind"