2806,"samples":21560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":62951.169348,"text":"이리저리 뒤섞습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":63180.777686,"text":"It mixes around randomly."},{"kind":"audio","t":63261.250661000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63265.589936000004,"samples":32032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":69635.487191,"text":"벌레라는 용어는 곤충학자들이 이러한 종류의 곤충을 격식을 갖추어 부르는 말이다."},{"kind":"text","t":70324.704631,"text":"The term “worm” is the formal name used by entomologists to refer to this type of insect."},{"kind":"audio","t":70424.627299,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70429.66493099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70435.13301599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70440.50107299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70445.34846899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"audio","t":70445.65273399999,"samples":560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":78541.84805799999,"text":"첫째 대부분의 기수들은 힐이 있고 밑창이 매끈하고 좁은 승마화를 신습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":79073.67064699999,"text":"First, most riders wear riding boots with heels and smooth, narrow soles."},{"kind":"audio","t":79159.66434599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79164.85451599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79170.052486,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79175.33507399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":79175.670978,"samples":1528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":89484.62749299999,"text":"10월에 시작된 광범위한 반정권 프로테스트에 대한 멀토이의 대응 차원에서 위원회가 마련되었습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":90146.310862,"text":"The committee was established as Muldoon’s response to the widespread anti-government protests that began in October."},{"kind":"audio","t":90258.364087,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90263.56684799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90268.87282799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90274.07727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90279.195582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90284.502152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":90284.846936,"samples":9192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":95360.258323,"text":"소방 구조대원들이 결국 오후 11시 35분까지 불을 껐다."},{"kind":"text","t":95914.729175,"text":"Firefighters finally extinguished the fire by 11:35 p.m."},{"kind":"audio","t":96015.253285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96016.883957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96018.365332,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96019.78641799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":96019.933316,"samples":928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":102059.518487,"text":"대서양 허리케인의 열 번째 폭풍인 아열대 폭풍 제리가"},{"kind":"text","t":102533.06098499999,"text":"Tropical Storm Jerry, the tenth storm of the Atlantic hurricane season,"},{"kind":"audio","t":102631.942554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102637.086146,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102643.34719999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102647.73086499999,"samples":31296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":105267.119155,"text":"오늘 대서양에서 생성되었습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":105550.437557,"text":"It formed in the Atlantic today."},{"kind":"audio","t":105642.282975,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":105647.162182,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":105647.490997,"samples":2264,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":111532.470997,"text":"그것은 기차와 자동차 및 여러 교통수단을 가져다 주었습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":111979.111893,"text":"It brought trains, cars, and various other modes of transportation."},{"kind":"audio","t":112071.421233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112076.239151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112081.514491,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":112085.11984999999,"samples":25296,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":121180.575099,"text":"사치의 진원지라는 명성은 서기 400년경에 시작하여 서기 1100년경까지 이어졌습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":121956.488745,"text":"Its reputation as a center of luxury began around 400 AD and lasted until around 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":122057.033765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122062.323055,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":122067.499797,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122072.780218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":122077.85947099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":122083.285179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122088.52189999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":122088.809515,"samples":2824,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":128663.322321,"text":"달의 표면은 돌과 먼지로 이루어져 있는데 달의 바깥층은 크러스트라고 불린다."},{"kind":"text","t":129321.528039,"text":"The Moon’s surface is made up of rocks and dust, and its outer layer is called the crust."},{"kind":"audio","t":129413.84236899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129418.97321099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129424.182533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129429.6467,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129431.43473,"samples":17128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":138854.316961,"text":"미국 공병대는 시간당 6인치의 강우량이 기파손된 제방을 무너뜨릴 수 있다고 추정했다."},{"kind":"text","t":139598.411148,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that rainfall of 6 inches per hour could cause damaged dikes to collapse."},{"kind":"audio","t":139705.010256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139710.25211600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139715.53503700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139720.577311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139725.964899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139730.86178600002,"samples":31160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":146908.83253,"text":"특히 미세한 표정을 정확하게 해석해서 사람이 거짓말을 하고 있는지 여부를 검출할 수 있다고 주장합니다."},{"kind":"text","t":147496.31599,"text":"It claims that it can accurately interpret subtle facial expressions to detect whether a person is lying."},{"kind":"audio","t":147594.816315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147599.987467,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147605.21613800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147610.20061300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":147615.62765100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147618.926035,"samples":20960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":152943.60890300001,"text":"구조물을 긁거나 낙서해서 현장을 더럽히지 마시오."},{"kind":"text","t":153448.292831,"text":"Do not damage the site by scratching or scribbling on the structures."},{"kind":"audio","t":153548.75665300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153554.050113,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153559.219645,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153560.481134,"samples":13896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":161487.352604,"text":"호랑이의 포효는 사자의 우렁찬 포효와는 다르지만"},{"kind":"text","t":161998.480012,"text":"The roar of a tiger is different from the loud roar of a lion."},{"kind":"audio","t":162085.96950500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162087.30932200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162088.91867400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":162089.136741,"samples":10896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":166514.19211600002,"text":"으르렁거리며 소리지르는 단어의 문장과 비슷합니다."},{"kind":"text","t":166989.10732100002,"text":"It’s similar to a sentence with words that growl and shout."},{"kind":"audio","t":167075.630509,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167082.405724,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167087.814342,"samples":31664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":175233.55657000002,"text":"20세기의 연구에 따르면 숨겨지거나 나타나는 두 가지 유전적 변이 집단이 있습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":175874.461382,"text":"According to 20th-century research, there are two genetic variation groups: hidden and apparent."},{"kind":"audio","t":175968.900786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175973.98185,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":175979.39899800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175985.339337,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":175985.75153,"samples":6928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":176045.93180700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176047.166715,"samples":15832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"close","t":186806.376414,"code":1005}]}